:: Avery Reconcile Ignore
<<effects>>
You keep your head down and find a seat far from the booth. Avery never looks your way.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Approach
<<effects>>
<<if $averyReconcile.stage is 3>>
	You cross the room for the fourth time. Nobody laughs yet; they're all watching Avery, waiting to see what <<he>> does with you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Accept]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy" or $speech_attitude is "special") or $speech_attitude_avery>>
		"Avery," you say, once you're close enough. "I'm sorry. For everything. Please."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Fine," you say, stopping beside the booth. "I was wrong. There. I said it."
	<<else>>
		"Avery," you say. "I owe you an apology, and I'd like to give it properly."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $averyReconcile.stage is 0>>
		<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Reject 1]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $averyReconcile.stage is 1>>
		<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Reject 2]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Reject 3]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Avery Reconcile Reject 1
<<effects>>
Avery doesn't look up. <<He>> finishes what <<he>> was saying to <<his>> companion, unhurried,
then turns <<his>> glass a quarter turn on the table.
<br><br>
"I'm sorry," <<he>> says at last, "do I know you?"
<br><br>
The companion beside <<him>> laughs, a small polite laugh, and looks at you the way you'd look at a stain.
Avery lifts two fingers towards the bar without breaking eye contact with <<his>> companion.
"If you're working tonight, we'll have another round."
<br><br>
You stand there long enough to understand that the conversation has already resumed without you.
<<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 3>><<gtrauma>>
<br><br>
<<set $averyReconcile.stage to 1>>
<i>Perhaps <<he>>'ll be <span class="pink">at the pub again next week</span>.</i>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the pub|Harvest Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Reject 2
<<effects>>
This time <<he>> does look up. <<He>> holds up a hand, and the table goes quiet.
<br><br>
"Louder," <<he>> says. "My friends couldn't hear you."
<br><br>
<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy" or $speech_attitude is "special") or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	You repeat it, but your voice breaks halfway through. The apology sounds more like you're begging <<him>> to believe you.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	You clench your jaw and force the apology out again, loud enough for the people nearby to hear the anger in your voice.
<<else>>
	You repeat it, louder, and hear how flat it sounds across a room that has stopped talking.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Reject 2.1]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Reject 2.1
<<effects>>
Avery says nothing for a few seconds. <<He>> looks you over from your shoes to your face, then turns back to <<his>> associates.
"That's who I was bringing around with me for a while," <<he>> says. "You can see why I stopped."
<br><br>
Someone near the bar snorts with laughter. The conversations around you start again, louder than before, and nobody speaks to you.
<<stress 10>><<ggstress>><<trauma 6>><<ggtrauma>>
<br><br>
<<set $averyReconcile.stage to 2>>
<i>You could <span class="pink">try again next week</span>, if you're willing to go through it again.</i>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the pub|Harvest Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Reject 3
<<effects>>
Avery smiles this time, which is worse. <<He>> plucks a napkin from the table and lets it fall between <<his>> shoes.
<br><br>
"Since you're here," <<he>> says.
<br><br>
<<if $submissive gte 1150>>
	You're kneeling before you've decided to. The crowd around the booth notices, and enjoys it.
<<elseif $submissive lte 850>>
	You stay standing for as long as your pride lasts, which is not very long with a dozen people watching.
	You kneel and pick it up.
<<else>>
	You hesitate, then bend and pick it up while the crowd watches.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Reject 3.1]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Reject 3.1
<<effects>>
You hold the napkin out to <<him>>. <<He>> takes it, dabs the corner of <<his>> mouth, and drops it back into your palm.
Then <<he>> tips <<his>> glass over your head.
<br><br>
The drink runs cold down your face and into your clothes. The laughter isn't polite this time.
"There," Avery says, dabbing at nothing. "Now you look how you behaved."
<<upperwet 200>><<lowerwet 100>>
<<stress 10>><<ggstress>><<trauma 12>><<gggtrauma>>
<br><br>
Someone behind the bar hands you a towel without meeting your eyes.
<br><br>
<<set $averyReconcile.stage to 3>>
<i>There's nothing left of you for <<him>> to humiliate. <span class="pink">You could try one last time</span>.</i>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the pub|Harvest Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Accept
<<effects>>
You reach the booth and <<he>> speaks before you can.
"Sit down."
<br><br>
You sit. Avery watches you in silence. From the look on <<his>> face, <<he>> has already made <<his>> decision.
<br><br>
Still, you try.
<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy" or $speech_attitude is "special") or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I'm sorry," you say, quieter than any of the other times. "That's all I came to say."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm not doing this a fifth time," you say. "I'm sorry. Take it or don't."
<<else>>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "I won't try to make it sound better than it was."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"I know," <<he>> says. "You came back three times, after I made sure everyone in this building watched what happened to you.
Nobody sits through that for the sake of a free drink and a seat at my table."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Avery Reconcile Accept 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Reconcile Accept 2
<<effects>>
<<He>> signals for another glass and has it set in front of you.
"I'm not a forgiving <<nnpc_gender "Avery">>. I'm a patient one. There's a difference, and you've just learned it."
<br><br>
<<He>> touches your hand across the table, briefly, and takes it back.
"Saturday. Eight o'clock, Domus Street. Wear something that doesn't embarrass me."
<<npcincr Avery love 2>><<glove>><<npcincr Avery rage -5>><<llarage>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<unDismissAvery>>
<<unset $averyReconcile>>
<<unset $weekly.averyReconcileSeen>>
<<if isPossibleLoveInterest("Avery")>>
	<<loveInterestAdd "Avery">>
<<else>>
	<span class="green">Avery is part of your life again.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave the pub|Harvest Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Lounge Cat
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_lounge">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<npc "Avery">><<person1>>
You sit down at the far end of the sofa. Avery keeps watching the television, but moves <<his>> legs aside to give you more room.
<br><br>
<<link [[Crawl into Avery's lap|Mansion Lounge Cat Lap]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Rest your head on Avery's chest and purr|Mansion Lounge Cat Purr]]>><</link>><<larage>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[Just watch the television (0:15)|Mansion Lounge]]>><<pass 15>><<stress -6>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>

:: Mansion Lounge Cat Lap
<<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
You turn towards Avery and move across the sofa on your hands and knees. When you reach <<him>>, you lower yourself across <<his>> thighs and make yourself comfortable.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 40>>
	<<He>> stops moving and looks down at you. "You're on my legs."
	<br><br>
	You stay where you are. Avery waits a few seconds, then grips your upper arm and pulls you upright. <<He>> guides you off <<his>> thighs before placing you on the empty cushion beside <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	"Sit there." <<He>> releases your arm and turns back towards the television, leaving no room for argument.
	<<npcincr Avery rage 5>><<garage>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> looks down at you and makes a quiet sound of complaint, but makes no attempt to move you.
	After a few seconds, <<he>> places one hand on your back and turns <<his>> attention to the television again.
	<br><br>
	You remain on <<his>> lap while <<he>> watches the football. Whenever you shift your position, <<his>> hand moves with you to keep you steady.
	<br><br>
	After several minutes, Avery speaks without looking away from the television. "You are extremely heavy."
	<br><br>
	Despite the complaint, <<he>> still makes no attempt to move you.
	<<npcincr Avery love 3>><<glove>><<npcincr Avery rage -5>><<larage>><<stress -12>><<lllstress>><<trauma -6>><<lltrauma>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Lounge]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Lounge Cat Purr
<<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
You move closer to Avery until your side presses against <<his>>. You rest your head on <<his>> chest, leaving one arm between yourself and the back of the sofa.
<br><br>
Avery looks down at you, but does not tell you to move. <<He>> keeps the remote in one hand and turns back to the television.
<br><br>
After a few seconds, a quiet purr comes from your throat. You pause when you hear it, but the sound continues as you relax against <<him>>.
Avery stops moving when <<he>> notices. <<He>> looks down at you again, then lifts <<his>> free hand and places it on top of your head.
<br><br>
<<His>> fingers move slowly through your hair. You close your eyes and keep purring while <<he>> continues stroking your head.
<br><br>
Avery says nothing about what <<hes>> doing. <<He>> keeps watching the football with one hand holding the remote and the other resting on your head.
<<npcincr Avery love 3>><<glove>><<npcincr Avery rage -5>><<larage>><<stress -12>><<lllstress>><<trauma -6>><<lltrauma>><<transform cat 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Lounge]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Return Bath First
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You head upstairs to the bathroom and fill the bath with hot water. Once it is ready, you climb in and start washing the mess from your skin.
Some of it comes away easily, while the rest takes more scrubbing before it finally washes off.
<br><br>
The water grows dirty as you clean yourself, so you spend a little longer making sure nothing is left before climbing out.
<br><br>
You dry yourself properly, then leave the bathroom and head back downstairs.<<pass 20>><<wash>><<lstress>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
Avery is still waiting for you when you return. <<He>> looks at your hands and arms, then checks the rest of you before <<his>> expression relaxes.
"Much better. Now I don't have to worry about you covering the house in that filth."
<br><br>
<<avery_mansion_dom_events>>

:: Mansion Return Bath First Refuse
<<effects>>
"I'm fine like this," you say, making no move towards the stairs.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.dom gte 40>>
	Avery presses <<his>> lips together as <<he>> looks at the mess still covering you. "Fine. Then keep away from my furniture until you decide to clean yourself."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> points towards the sofa before turning away. "And don't even think about sitting there."
<<else>>
	Avery looks at you for a few seconds, then sighs. "Suit yourself. I'm not going to drag you into the bathroom."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> points towards the sofa. "Just stay off that until you've washed. I don't want to clean it after you."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>


:: Avery Mod Widgets [widget]
<<widget "averyMasturbateOption">>
	<<if $awareness gte 0 or $arousal gte 9000>>
		<<icon "avery-bedroom.png">><<link [[Masturbate in bed|Mansion Bedroom Masturbate]]>><<set $masturbationstart to 1>><<unset $finish>><<unset $sexstart>><<unset $fightstart>><<unset $timer>><<unset $timerMax>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "averydatewage">>
	<<set _averyRate to (_args[0] is "low") ? 1 : 10>>
	<<set _averyEndear to Number.isFinite($endear) ? $endear : 0>>
	<<set _averyPay to C.npc.Avery.love * _averyRate + _averyEndear * _averyRate + 10>>
	<<set _averyPay *= (1 + Math.clamp((($fame && Number.isFinite($fame.model)) ? $fame.model : 0) / 1000, 0, 4))>>
	<<set _averyPay to Math.max(1, Math.round(_averyPay))>>
	<<set _averyPay to divineTfIncome(_averyPay * 100, "avery") / 100>>
	<<if _args[1] is "pay">><<money `_averyPay * 100` "avery" { divineTfAdjusted: true }>><</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "avery_saved_swallow">>
	/* Saved route: Avery masters <<his>> temper at the last second instead of lashing out */
	<<set $avery_mansion.rage.timer to 30>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.rage.assess to 0>>
	<<if !$avery_passage>><<set $avery_passage to "Mansion Garage">><</if>>
	<<His>> jaw tightens. <<His>> hand snaps up between you, fingers spreading wide... and stops.
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
		<<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">>
	<</if>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		You flinch back with a small, broken whimper, throwing your hands up to shield your face. "P-Please don't...!"
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		You shrink away and squeeze your eyes shut, bracing for the blow.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		You go very still, holding your composure even as your breath catches in your throat.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You lower your gaze and go quiet, waiting to accept whatever <<he>> decides.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		You don't flinch. You hold <<his>> gaze, steady, waiting to see what <<he>>'ll actually do.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You lift your chin and glare right back, daring <<him>> to go through with it.
	<<else>>
		You tense, but stand your ground and meet <<his>> eyes.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> freezes there for a few seconds. Then <<he>> clenches <<his>> hand and breathes out through <<his>> nose.
	<<His>> shoulders slowly relax.<<lllarage>><<npcincr Avery rage -21>><<npcincr Avery love 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $bodysize gte 2>>
		Without a word, <<he>> steps in and hugs you into <<his>> arms, <<his>> chin coming to rest atop your head. <<He>> holds you a moment longer than you expect, then lets go and walks away in silence.
	<<else>>
		Without a word, <<he>> rests a hand atop your head and gives it two slow, careful pats. Then <<he>> turns and walks away in silence.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|$avery_passage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "avery_gym_bar_intro_check">>
	/* Fires the gym and bar reveal as soon as the PC walks in on Avery relaxing in the lounge. Any pending mansion interrupt takes priority, so vanilla events are never skipped. */
	<<if !$avery_mansion.gym_bar_intro and ($avery_fate is "saved" or $avery_fate is "ascended") and ($avery_mansion.schedule is "lounge" or $avery_mansion.schedule is "drink") and C.npc.Avery.rage lt 60 and $stress lt $stressmax and !$possessed>>
		<<avery_mansion_interrupt>>
		<<if !_avery_interrupt>>
			<<include "Mansion Gym Bar Intro">>
			<<exitAll>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "avery_gym_caught">>
	You hear Avery's voice somewhere in the house. You put everything back where it was and slip out before <<nnpc_he "Avery">> thinks to look in here.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Lounge]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>
